# =====================================================================
#  SYNTHETIC SAMPLE CORPUS  --  NOT REAL RONGORONGO DATA
# =====================================================================
#  This file exists only so the corpus-statistics pipeline can be run
#  and tested without a genuine corpus present. The glyph codes and
#  sequences below are INVENTED. They are NOT transliterations of any
#  real artifact and must never be used for research conclusions.
#
#  Every tablet here is marked '@synthetic' so analysis output flags it.
#
#  To analyze real data, place genuine .rrt transliterations in this
#  directory. See SOURCES.md for where to obtain a real corpus and the
#  expected file format.
# =====================================================================

@tablet SYN-A
@name Synthetic Sample A
@side recto
@synthetic
Aa1: 1 2 6 6 700 8 1 2 6 9
Aa2: 1 2 6 700 8 4 4 11 6 1
Aa3: 6-700 8 1 2 6 6 700 8 3 1
Aa4: 1 2 6 12 13 6 700 8 1 9
Aa5: 1 2 6 6 700 8 14 6 1 2

@tablet SYN-B
@name Synthetic Sample B
@side recto
@synthetic
Ba1: 6 1 2 6 700 8 6 1 2 6
Ba2: 8 1 2 6 6-700 8 1 9 6 1
Ba3: 1 2 6 700 8 1 2 6 700 8
Ba4: 15 6 16 1 2 6 6 700 17

@tablet SYN-C
@name Synthetic Sample C
@side verso
@synthetic
Ca1: 1 2 6 700 8 20 21 6 1 2
Ca2: 6 700 8 1 2 6 22 6 700 8
Ca3: 1 9 6 6 700 8 1 2 6 9
